From 3fa4a06b5d24fa9831c2772d99af3422c5a307dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hemang Nagar <hnagar@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 17:34:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] review: add --output json for scripts and other tools

The human text output truncates rule_text and summaries and is not a stable
contract for consumers. `--output json` emits the same query results as a
structured, untruncated shape: workspace, since, include_candidates,
repeated_failures[] and lessons[]. The default (text) output is unchanged.
Mirrors the existing `advice --output` flag.
